clark: Whoa, I got a long text message from a girl named Claire. #id:73
clark: I wonder who she is. #id:74
claire: Clark, I've been trying to contact you for the past month and it's been impossible for me. #id:75
claire: I've knocked your door and no one opened, I called you several times and no one answered even though I know you're there. #id:76
claire: I'm not in a great mental health mood and you knew that. This silence treatment doesn't do any well to me. #id:77
claire: The best solution is that we break up. #id:78
clark: Oh, right. I had a girlfriend #id:79
claire: I still remember when you used to take to the movies or dinner. I was so happy to share my life with with you. #id:7a
clark: Tch, whatever. #id:7b
claire: I was so happy that I actually was going to propose marriage to you. I already had the rings. I guess I'll give them to my sister. #id:7c
claire: I don't wish you any bad, Clark. I just hope that you can think about your actions and become a better partner for the next person that stumbles upon you. #id:7d
claire: Best of luck, Claire. #id:7e
clark: What a wasteful long text. She can go if she wants. She propably was cheating on me #id:7f
clark: She even says that she was gonna propose marriage. As if I have time for that #id:80
clark: Oh wait, I have another text message. It's from a dude called Bob #id:81
bob: Man, where the hell are you? You haven't been going to work for the past month. #id:82
bob: I've been covering your back ever since. The boss thinks you're sick #id:83
bob: I can only help you so much. Please come back on at least call me so you know you're alive. #id:84
clark: Oh, yeah. I worked as a salesman. #id:85
clark: I absolutely hated that job. They were planning on firing me. They never said anything about that, but I knew it. #id:86
clark: I bougth a new game. #id:87
clark: I love this console. It's the first console that lets me buy games online. #id:88
clark: I don't even have to go outside #id:89
clark: This new game is called "SpaceRun" #id:8a
clark: I don't know if it's gonna be good. #id:8b
clark: I only bought it because it was on sale #id:8c
Objective\: Get at least {space_run_target} points on SpaceRun #id:8d